{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NEW COLOSSAL DWARFARE CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHORT DWARF, BIG TROUBLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AND A ROBOT SO HUGE, IT COULD CRUSH THE ENTIRE KINGDOM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368630/extras/DLC-presentation-Enanos-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1738778252\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grymbeard always hated being in Wilbur\u2019s shadow. So, he decided to build an automaton big enough to cast one of his own\u2026 and subdue the Kingdom while he was at it. Powered by the mysterious Darksteel, the robot\u2019s nearly done. When it\u2019s finished, the evil Grymbeard will stand tall... well, his robot will! The Alliance must halt the assembly before it\u2019s too late!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368630/extras/cards--gameplay-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1738778252\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DLC FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 Treacherous New Stages through the Darksteel Mountain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 12 Deadly New Enemies: from clones to sinister mechanical creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 2 Dreadful Minibosses and 3 Epic Bosses, waiting to be disassembled!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 1 New Linirean Tower \u2013 the Cannoneer Squad makes an explosive debut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 1 New Dark Army Hero \u2013 Kratoa, the Molten Rage, awakens from his slumber</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> New Achievements for ultimate bragging rights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easter eggs packed with robotic surprises!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368630/extras/DLC-humor_cannon-ezgif.com-optim